stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> snapshot_unavailable: Missing snapshot or invalid observation
    [*] --> current_ready: Current valid meetings
    [*] --> current_partial_malformed: Rejected meeting, alternate time or review
    [*] --> stale_partial: Observation older than eighteen hours
    [*] --> future_partial: Observation is in the future
    [*] --> empty_current: Current snapshot without meetings
    snapshot_unavailable --> current_ready: Refresh with valid meetings
    current_partial_malformed --> current_ready: Refresh with valid times
    stale_partial --> current_ready: Refresh with current observation
    future_partial --> current_ready: Refresh with current observation
    empty_current --> current_ready: Refresh includes a meeting
    current_ready --> current_partial_malformed: Refresh includes an impossible instant
    %% never A rejected instant becomes another scheduled date.
    %% never An invalid observation certifies calendar coverage.
    %% never Rejected alternate times silently certify complete coverage.
